{"id": 992542, "slug": "road-to-exotics", "name": "ROAD TO EXOTICS!", "name_original": "ROAD TO EXOTICS!", "description": "<strong>ROAD TO EXOTICS!</strong> is a casual racing game inspired by arcade classics: Road Fighter, Out Run, Zippy Race, and others.<h3>300+ OPPONENTS SIMULTANEOUSLY:</h3>Yes, you read that right! \"ROAD TO EXOTICS!\" is about over-the-top racing mayhem, where you'll compete against 300+ opponents simultaneously! Run, Dodge, and outmaneuver the competition as you battle for the first place!<h3>COMPETE AGAINST THE CLOCK!:</h3>Navigate a series of strategically placed checkpoints, each with its time limit. Keep your wits about you as you race toward the next checkpoint while traffic holds you back. Dodge civilians! Then, reaching the final destination.<h3>FUEL MANAGEMENT:</h3>Every drop of fuel counts. Monitor your fuel gauge and collect through the racing track to ensure you have enough fuel to reach the finish line.<br/>A unique feeling of trying to reach the finish line with no fuel left in the tank!<h3>UNFORGETTABLE ENCOUNTERS:</h3>You must expect heart-pounding, high-speed crashes that will leave you on the edge of your seat. Collide, then try to regain control of your racing car or suffer the feeling of reaching last place!<h3>GAMEPAD SUPPORT</h3>Enjoy precision control and an authentic arcade experience, and relive those nostalgic moments with a modern twist.<br/><br/>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-11-11", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-11-15T07:56:49", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/261/261c47628dde3cbc6cff93cfbe7ef77e.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/0ff/0ff7991ca9b00e723bfa795cb17da327.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 10, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achieve